# --- The Veil: the core rule, taught once (DV19); the Doubt passive leaves the progression (20_structure.pl)
@loca h8cce4774gc43ag85c1gfbf4g7a2213dd6822 Every lie an enemy believes plants <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DOUBT_1">Doubt</LSTag> in it. At the third, it becomes <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DELUDED">Deluded</LSTag>.<br><br><LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_MirrorImage">Eidolon</LSTag> and <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_Distortion">Veilstep</LSTag> summon Doubles: illusions of you with 1 <LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints">hit point</LSTag> that act on their own turn and can <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_Deceiver_Double_Shatter">Splinter</LSTag>. You gain +1 <LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass">Armour Class</LSTag> for each one.
@loca THE_VEIL_EXTRA An enemy believes a lie when it destroys one of your Doubles, when a Splinter hits it, when your Seed bursts in it and when Malicious Whispers finds your Seed. Each stack of Doubt reduces its Wisdom Saving Throws and its Attack Rolls against you and your Doubles by 1.<br><br>You can keep 3 Doubles at once, 4 from level 7 and 5 from level 12. They vanish when combat ends, after a Long Rest or if you die.
@file Passive
@set Arcana_Passive_TheVeil ExtraDescription {{THE_VEIL_EXTRA}}
@loca h044da674g7686g830dg2f87g5b39f2ff46e4 Your Doubles can also cast <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Projectile_Deceiver_Double_MirrorSigil">Reflected Seed</LSTag> and <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Deceiver_Double_MirrorChains">Reflected Falsehood</LSTag>. Both deal half the damage of your <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Projectile_Arcana_Card_Spell_SigilofMalice">Seed of Doubt</LSTag> at your highest spell slot.

