# --- Class description (ClassDescriptions.lsx uses this handle)
@loca hcf1e5160g3e20g0953g6e16gd8b38b0e15f7 Mystra wove the Deceiver from the veil between what is and what seems, a thread that no one watching can follow. They scatter Doubles that splinter when struck, plant seeds of doubt until enemies can't trust their own eyes, and bind them with woven lies.
